-    validating a base that is already known-broken; that effort waits until main
-    is green, protecting scarce QA and human-tester time.
-  - >
-    Prioritize red recovery. Green main is the goal; a red main pulls to the
-    front of the maintainer queue. Land the fix through the normal PR flow
-    (no-direct-push is unchanged). Classify each red before acting on it, to
-    distinguish a genuine P0 red from a flake or pre-existing breakage while
-    working the queue.
 integrity_rules:
   - >
     Do NOT green-wash: never revert an honest red or decline to merge a bug's
