-procedures:
-  - "Scope the run to what changed. Point the mutation tool at the modules the
-    work package touched, not the whole codebase, so the run finishes inside a
-    review cycle and every survivor it reports is about code under review."
-  - "Read each surviving mutant as a located question. A survivor names a line
