+entry_condition: |
+  A design or implementation change introduces or modifies components, layers, or the dependencies between them.
+exit_condition: |
+  Every affected component has documented inputs, outputs, and dependencies; the design has been reviewed against existing boundaries; and any deviation from established patterns is recorded in an ADR with its rationale.
