+  description: |
+    Define explicit component boundaries before implementation begins; document inputs, outputs, and dependencies for each component.
+- title: Separate concerns at every layer
+  description: |
+    Separate concerns at every layer (data, logic, presentation, infrastructure) so that changes to one concern do not propagate into others.
+- title: Review the design against existing boundaries
+  description: |
+    Review proposed designs against existing boundaries to identify coupling violations before code is written.
