-procedures:
-  - Emit the human-readable half through an EXISTING operator-visible sink (CLI output, doctor/status JSON, the event log, a non-zero exit code). Never route the signal through a new bespoke sink that can itself be swallowed — reuse a surface operators already watch, because per epics #3410/#3549 an un-watched sink is indistinguishable from no signal.
